{%- comment -%}
  The funnel's inline scripts, in page order: three Swiper initialisations (the
  announcement bar, the gallery thumbnails, the review slider), the video controls,
  the FAQ accordion, the sticky bar and the offer toggle. They must run after the
  markup exists, so this is the last section in the template rather than part of
  pc-bootstrap.

  Checkout Champ's index.js is deliberately absent -- pc-cart.js replaces the order
  handling it used to do.
{%- endcomment -%}
